      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Tap PULSE (LMB or A) for a nudge, hold it to swell the ring and hit harder.
    \nTap DASH (LSHIFT or RT) to boost in the direction of the forward marker.\n\nHit
    the ball for an air-hockey push. \n\nKeep to your own area of the pitch.\n\nWINNING\n\nGoals
    count against the team that let them in. Concede five and you are out; the last
    team standing wins.\n\nOVERTIME\n\nThe jumbotrons count down from 5:00. At zero
    the ball turns lethal and only a Pulse can move it. It stays safe until someone
    pulses it, then it belongs to them - and anyone it touches is vaporised, conceding
    a goal.\n\nOptional in 2 player. Always on in 4 player."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
